    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀορτ-ήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀείρω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strap to hang</i> anything
				<i>to, sword-belt,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.609
			</span></i>: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουλεὸν . . χρυσέοισιν ἀορτήρεσσιν
					ἀρηρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.31
				</span></i>
			 (also expl. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κρίκοι τῆς θήκης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.438
			</span></i>
			<i>knapsack-strap,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφος ἀορτήρ,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρόφος.</span>
			</div>
